          <li><strong>Service Principals (azuread_service_principal):</strong> App roles and OAuth2 permissions</li>
          <li><strong>Invitations (azuread_invitation):</strong> Guest user invitation details with email and redirect URLs</li>
          <li><strong>Users (azuread_user):</strong> User profiles with attributes like display name, UPN, and mail</li>
        </ul>
